WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.935
Start with the pack you want, or measure the space you have.

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:03.867
Lay the cells flat and divide the pack into two banks.

00:00:03.867 --> 00:00:06.818
Choose 12 groups in series and four cells in each group.

00:00:06.818 --> 00:00:08.750
Stagger the rows and choose what separates them.

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:10.769
Reserve space for the battery management board.

00:00:10.769 --> 00:00:12.885
Adjust case clearance and opacity to see the fit.

00:00:12.885 --> 00:00:15.428
Review the two banks. Each parallel group stays in its own bank.

00:00:15.428 --> 00:00:17.813
Open the editor and pick the part you want to change.

00:00:17.813 --> 00:00:24.677
For a sloped or stepped battery box, draw its inside outline.

00:00:24.677 --> 00:00:26.946
Set the width across the box and preview the cells inside.

00:00:26.946 --> 00:00:29.280
Use this outline in the battery builder.
